{{Wt/tig/head|uncertain|tr=hā}}

==== {{Wt/tig/S|translations}} ====
* {{Wt/tig/L|en}}:
*# first letter of the alphabet
*# to {{Wt/tig/t|en|begin|English}}
*# exclamation to call back a camel to the flock
* {{Wt/tig/L|ar}}:
*# {{Wt/tig/t|ar|بدأ|Arabic|بَدَأَ}}
*# {{Wt/tig/t|ar|ابتدأ|Arabic|اِبْتَدَأَ}}
* {{Wt/tig/L|ti}}:
*# {{Wt/tig/t|ti|ሰረቐ|Tigrinya}}

==== {{Wt/tig/S|related}} ====
* [[Wt/tig/ሀ ቤለ|ሀ ቤለ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|basic stem}}) – he began
* [[Wt/tig/ሀ አበለ|ሀ አበለ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|causative stem}}) – he drove back a camel to the flock
{{Wt/tig/hasform|basic stem}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|causative stem}}

