* [[Wt/tig/ሀሁሂ አበለ|ሀሁሂ አበለ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|causative stem}}) – he taught the alphabet
{{Wt/tig/hasform|causative stem}}

{{Wt/tig/also|ሀላ}} == {{Wt/tig/L|tig}} ==
