==== {{Wt/tig/S|translations}} ==== * {{Wt/tig/L|en}}: *# he brayed (donkey) ''(to {{Wt/tig/t|en|bray|English}} (donkey))'' *# he covered ''(to {{Wt/tig/t|en|cover|English}})'' * {{Wt/tig/L|ar}}: *# {{Wt/tig/t|ar|نهق|Arabic|نَهَقَ}} *# {{Wt/tig/t|ar|غطى|Arabic|غَطَّى}}
==== {{Wt/tig/S|related}} ==== * [[Wt/tig/ሀለለ|ሀለለ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|basic stem}}) – he rocked (v.t. and i.) * [[Wt/tig/ሀለሎት|ሀለሎት]] ({{Wt/tig/S|verbal noun}}; {{Wt/tig/S|also}} [[Wt/tig/ህላለት|ህላለት]], [[Wt/tig/ሃለለ|ሃለለ]]) – he painted the face * [[Wt/tig/ምህላል|ምህላል]] ({{Wt/tig/S|verbal noun}}; {{Wt/tig/S|also}} [[Wt/tig/ህላት|ህላት]]) – dark-light colouring * [[Wt/tig/ሁሉል|ሁሉል]] ({{Wt/tig/S|passive participle}}) – striped (like a zebra); painted, beautiful * [[Wt/tig/ተሀለለ|ተሀለለ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|passive/reflexive stem}}) – he was covered; he was weak, lost a lawsuit * [[Wt/tig/ተሃለለ|ተሃለለ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|reciprocal stem}}) – he was painted (in stripes); he painted himself * [[Wt/tig/አትሀለለ|አትሀለለ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|causative-reflexive stem}}) – he caused to be covered * [[Wt/tig/አትሃለለ|አትሃለለ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|causative-reflexive stem}}) – he let rock * [[Wt/tig/እትሃለለ|እትሃለለ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|causative-reflexive stem}}) – he let himself be painted * [[Wt/tig/ህላል|ህላል]] ({{Wt/tig/S|noun}}; {{Wt/tig/S|also}} [[Wt/tig/ህላለት|ህላለት]]) – foal (donkey) * [[Wt/tig/ህላዔ|ህላዔ]] – bray (donkey) {{Wt/tig/hasform|basic stem}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|verbal noun}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|passive participle}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|passive/reflexive stem}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|reciprocal stem}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|causative-reflexive stem}}

