==== {{Wt/tig/S|related}} ==== * [[Wt/tig/ሀለበት|ሀለበት]] ({{Wt/tig/S|verbal noun}}) – bleeding * [[Wt/tig/ያለበ|ያለበ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|basic stem}}) – he made incisions * [[Wt/tig/ሁሉብ|ሁሉብ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|passive participle}}) – covered with scars * [[Wt/tig/ተሀለበ|ተሀለበ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|passive/reflexive stem}}) – he was bled; he became scarred * [[Wt/tig/ተያለበ|ተያለበ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|reciprocal stem}}) – pass. to O3; he was bled * [[Wt/tig/አትሀለበ|አትሀለበ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|causative-reflexive stem}}) – he assisted in bleeding * [[Wt/tig/ምህላብ|ምህላብ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|noun}}; {{Wt/tig/S|plural}} [[Wt/tig/መሃልብ|መሃልብ]]) – scar, incision * [[Wt/tig/መሀላብ|መሀላብ]] ({{Wt/tig/S|noun}}) – instrument (knife) for bleeding {{Wt/tig/hasform|verbal noun}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|basic stem}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|passive participle}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|passive/reflexive stem}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|reciprocal stem}}{{Wt/tig/hasform|causative-reflexive stem}}

